# Assertions Operator Showcase

Every `assertions-table` operator, exercised against one real [httpbin.org/get](https://httpbin.org) response — including a couple of deliberate gotchas (row 4: a query param is always a *string*, even when it looks numeric) that are exactly the kind of thing this table is meant to catch.

